# The qits CLI binary, fetched into the build context before `buildctl build` and COPYed by the
# Dockerfile. It is NOT source: it is a released artifact of qits-platform-access-cli, ~42 MB of
# native binary, and the only committed statement about it is the Dockerfile's one
# `ARG QITS_CLI_VERSION=` line. Both CI recipes write it here, and so does anybody following
# README.md's "Building by hand" — so without this line the next `git add -A` in a workspace quietly
# stages 42 MB of downloaded binary into the history of an image recipe, under a name that would then
# shadow the fetch on every later build.
/qits
